{"content_hash": "070d062372ba7563", "version_id": 934, "article_id": 94, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Shennong Group chairman hands ex-wife 14.9% stake as pig prices fall", "title_zh": "猪价跌不停，神农集团董事长离婚分给前妻近15%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8198696.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554228168-dfcd8cbe15fe?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y2hpbmVzZSUyMHBpZyUyMGZhcm1lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0MzYwMTc2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Ben Mater on Unsplash", "author": "Ben Mater", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benjmater?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/woman-sitting-in-front-of-pig-ek56eeYMKoQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(257, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(295, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 258, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "The chairman of Yunnan pig producer Shennong Group has transferred a large block of shares to his ex-wife after their divorce. The split comes as the industry fights a deep downturn and the family's succession plan remains unfinished.", "lead_zh": "云南养猪企业神农集团董事长离婚后，把一大笔股份转给了前妻。此时行业正深陷低谷，家族接班计划也还没走完。", "preview": "He Zuxun, chairman of Shennong Group, has ended his marriage to Luo Wanyu. Under the settlement, he moved 30% of his 261 million shares, or ", "preview_zh": "神农集团董事长何祖训与罗婉瑜解除婚姻关系。根据财产分割安排，他把自己持有的2.61亿股中的30%、即7830.5万股过户给对方。按公告日收盘价每股31.7元计算，这部分市值约24.8亿元。双方还签署了一致行动协议，因此上市公司控制权没有变化。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 918, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 99.375, "size_bytes": 597168, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 295, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 101.6, "size_bytes": 610560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 295, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 108.225, "size_bytes": 650304, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 295, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 93.375, "size_bytes": 561168, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 295, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 100.05, "size_bytes": 601200, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 295, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@b7c82c2/content/data/versions/934.json", "paragraphs": ["He Zuxun, chairman of Shennong Group, has ended his marriage to Luo Wanyu. Under the settlement, he moved 30% of his 261 million shares, or 78.305 million shares, to her. At the closing price of 31.7 yuan on the announcement day, the stake was worth about 2.48 billion yuan. The couple also signed an agreement to vote together, so control of the listed company does not change.", "The transfer lands in a painful market. Pig prices have fallen below 9 yuan per kilogram, and the ratio of pig prices to feed costs is around 3.85 to 1, far under the 6 to 1 break-even line. Most producers lose money on every pig they sell. Shennong's revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan in the first three quarters, but it posted a net loss and its operating cash flow kept draining.", "Shennong is protecting cash rather than growing. It cancelled a planned 290 million yuan share placement and paused a pig farm project in Guangxi. It is also putting more money into existing farms in Yunnan. Dividends have been shelved again this year, though its debt ratio of 46% and about 2 billion yuan in reserves leave it relatively comfortable.", "The divorce also reshapes the family's succession. He Zuxun, 61, has spent seven years preparing his son He Xinyang, who is not Luo's child, through roles in purchasing, operations and human resources. He Xinyang sits on no board and owns no shares. With Luo now holding close to 15%, the shares He can use for a handover have shrunk."], "paragraphs_zh": ["神农集团董事长何祖训与罗婉瑜解除婚姻关系。根据财产分割安排，他把自己持有的2.61亿股中的30%、即7830.5万股过户给对方。按公告日收盘价每股31.7元计算，这部分市值约24.8亿元。双方还签署了一致行动协议，因此上市公司控制权没有变化。", "这笔过户发生在行情艰难之时。猪价已跌破每公斤9元，猪粮比约为3.85比1，远低于6比1的盈亏平衡线，多数猪企卖一头亏一头。神农集团前三季度营收增长5%至41.2亿元，但归母净利润亏损，经营现金流持续净流出。", "神农集团选择保现金而不是扩张。它终止了2.9亿元的定增计划，并暂停广西一个猪场项目，同时把更多资金投向云南本土存量猪场。今年分红再次搁置，不过46%的资产负债率和约20亿元资金储备让它相对从容。", "这场离婚也改变了家族传承格局。61岁的何祖训用七年时间培养儿子何昕阳，让他先后在采购、运营和人力资源等岗位历练。何昕阳没有进入董事会，也不持有股份。如今罗婉瑜手握近15%股权，何祖训可用于接班安排的股份筹码被压缩了。"], "body": "He Zuxun, chairman of Shennong Group, has ended his marriage to Luo Wanyu. Under the settlement, he moved 30% of his 261 million shares, or 78.305 million shares, to her. At the closing price of 31.7 yuan on the announcement day, the stake was worth about 2.48 billion yuan. The couple also signed an agreement to vote together, so control of the listed company does not change.\n\nThe transfer lands in a painful market. Pig prices have fallen below 9 yuan per kilogram, and the ratio of pig prices to feed costs is around 3.85 to 1, far under the 6 to 1 break-even line. Most producers lose money on every pig they sell. Shennong's revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan in the first three quarters, but it posted a net loss and its operating cash flow kept draining.\n\nShennong is protecting cash rather than growing. It cancelled a planned 290 million yuan share placement and paused a pig farm project in Guangxi. It is also putting more money into existing farms in Yunnan. Dividends have been shelved again this year, though its debt ratio of 46% and about 2 billion yuan in reserves leave it relatively comfortable.\n\nThe divorce also reshapes the family's succession. He Zuxun, 61, has spent seven years preparing his son He Xinyang, who is not Luo's child, through roles in purchasing, operations and human resources. He Xinyang sits on no board and owns no shares. With Luo now holding close to 15%, the shares He can use for a handover have shrunk.", "body_zh": "神农集团董事长何祖训与罗婉瑜解除婚姻关系。根据财产分割安排，他把自己持有的2.61亿股中的30%、即7830.5万股过户给对方。按公告日收盘价每股31.7元计算，这部分市值约24.8亿元。双方还签署了一致行动协议，因此上市公司控制权没有变化。\n\n这笔过户发生在行情艰难之时。猪价已跌破每公斤9元，猪粮比约为3.85比1，远低于6比1的盈亏平衡线，多数猪企卖一头亏一头。神农集团前三季度营收增长5%至41.2亿元，但归母净利润亏损，经营现金流持续净流出。\n\n神农集团选择保现金而不是扩张。它终止了2.9亿元的定增计划，并暂停广西一个猪场项目，同时把更多资金投向云南本土存量猪场。今年分红再次搁置，不过46%的资产负债率和约20亿元资金储备让它相对从容。\n\n这场离婚也改变了家族传承格局。61岁的何祖训用七年时间培养儿子何昕阳，让他先后在采购、运营和人力资源等岗位历练。何昕阳没有进入董事会，也不持有股份。如今罗婉瑜手握近15%股权，何祖训可用于接班安排的股份筹码被压缩了。", "text": "He Zuxun, chairman of Shennong Group, has ended his marriage to Luo Wanyu. Under the settlement, he moved 30% of his 261 million shares, or 78.305 million shares, to her. At the closing price of 31.7 yuan on the announcement day, the stake was worth about 2.48 billion yuan. The couple also signed an agreement to vote together, so control of the listed company does not change. The transfer lands in a painful market. Pig prices have fallen below 9 yuan per kilogram, and the ratio of pig prices to feed costs is around 3.85 to 1, far under the 6 to 1 break-even line. Most producers lose money on every pig they sell. Shennong's revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan in the first three quarters, but it posted a net loss and its operating cash flow kept draining. Shennong is protecting cash rather than growing. It cancelled a planned 290 million yuan share placement and paused a pig farm project in Guangxi. It is also putting more money into existing farms in Yunnan. Dividends have been shelved again this year, though its debt ratio of 46% and about 2 billion yuan in reserves leave it relatively comfortable. The divorce also reshapes the family's succession. He Zuxun, 61, has spent seven years preparing his son He Xinyang, who is not Luo's child, through roles in purchasing, operations and human resources. He Xinyang sits on no board and owns no shares. With Luo now holding close to 15%, the shares He can use for a handover have shrunk.", "vocab": [{"word": "settlement", "pos": "noun", "zh": "财产分割协议", "note": "此处指离婚财产安排", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stake", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份；股权", "note": "商业新闻高频词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "break-even", "pos": "adj", "zh": "盈亏平衡的", "note": "break-even line 盈亏线", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drain", "pos": "verb", "zh": "消耗；流失", "note": "cash flow drains 现金流流失", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "placement", "pos": "noun", "zh": "定增；配售", "note": "share placement 定向增发", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shelve", "pos": "verb", "zh": "搁置", "note": "dividends shelved 分红搁置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "debt ratio", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "资产负债率", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "succession", "pos": "noun", "zh": "接班；传承", "note": "family succession 家族传承", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "handover", "pos": "noun", "zh": "交接；交棒", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reshape", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重塑；改变", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "downturn", "pos": "noun", "zh": "低迷期；下行", "note": "industry downturn 行业下行", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reserves", "pos": "noun", "zh": "储备资金", "note": "常用复数", "phonetic":